# C11 firmware style (ADR-0001). 4-space indent to match ESP-IDF code we read daily.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
Language: Cpp
IndentWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 100
BreakBeforeBraces: Linux
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: None
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: Never
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: false
PointerAlignment: Right
AlignConsecutiveMacros: Consecutive
# ESP-IDF headers can be order-sensitive (sdkconfig.h, FreeRTOS.h before task.h).
SortIncludes: Never
